{"job_id":"F-5a095a8cc1c6209fc036","family_id":"F-5a095a8cc1c6209fc036","title":"사법행정의 예고에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":15,"target_id":"c0420b074c0826e562a9af88efaf0323af9db922dd68c64611235982bce3d784","source_hash":"3ed2352402a87a0e4fa055a3ddf5f8a70836a6f3f7896764ab15fed0658dc2c3","text":"关于司法行政预先通知的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":253,"target_id":"961aafa5cced0f385a11fa6b38296b221d5c0e8465c890a3f44b2d91c1e4fef1","source_hash":"60381b8347b5377be17b674735a0064d7eefc34f82ac4f6b049bd51fd9687c41","text":"第一条（目的）本规则旨在通过透明、公正地进行司法行政程序，保障人民的权利和利益，提高政策可预测性，扩大公众参与司法行政程序的范围。本规则规定了法院行政办公室、司法研究培训院、司法政策研究所、法院官员培训院、国家法院图书馆、量刑委员会、最高人民法院道德监察员以及各级法院（以下简称“各级机构”）依据《行政程序法》（以下简称“本法”）第四十六条第一款进行行政通知的必要事项。<2021年3月25日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"BODY","start":253,"end":533,"target_id":"709c5d0f163fbda8d148ecec22e84d0eff4d0a45632f684fb86a3e85a0f9b2fa","source_hash":"c9f671bb8374b326cf0264ce72e73e369cef12afdcdc562e461548d7c76fc7a0","text":"第二条（行政公告事项） 依本法第四十六条第一款规定，各级机关应当进行行政公告的事项，举例如下。但是，其他法律或者最高法院判例规定应当按照公告程序进行公众查阅、检查、公开听证、辩论、说明会等的，应当适用该等法律或者最高法院判例。\n1. 各级政府机关搬迁的政策、制度和计划（不包括涉及立法的情况）\n2. 各级政府大楼安装图像信息处理设备的政策、系统和计划\n3. 各级政府建筑门禁控制政策、系统和计划\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"BODY","start":533,"end":1217,"target_id":"22ce334ba9ba09b12505d7001ad934ad72747d62eb52bc6c72947e81b168b11e","source_hash":"f000da658ee41c163170fcd7188e474b2fb43efaadcb8a04ea264a0426f3f71b","text":"第三条（行政通知方式）\n① 法院行政办公室部长、司法研究培训院院长、司法政策研究所所长、法院官员培训院院长、法院图书馆馆长、量刑委员会主席、最高法院道德监察长以及各级法院院长（以下统称“各级机构负责人”）拟制定、实施或者变更各自机构的政策、制度和计划（以下统称“政策等”）时，应当依据本法第四十六条第一款的规定，发布行政通知。<2021年3月25日修订>\n② 行政通知应当在各机关网站发布（法院行政办公室和最高法院道德监察员的行政通知，指法院网站；以下同上）。但如有必要，各机关负责人可以通过官方公报、法院公报、日报、互联网、广播、相关组织或机构的出版物等方式发布行政通知。<2021年3月25日修订>\n③ 各级机关负责人发布行政通知时，应当按照本条例附件一表格规定，具体说明行政通知草案的主要内容、程序、征求意见期限、负责人、征求意见地点等。\n④ 各机关负责人发布行政通知时，应当将通知事项告知中央行政机关、地方政府以及其他与政策建议有关系的组织，或者通过其他方式告知他们，以便他们了解行政事项。\n⑤ 各机构负责人可以按照本机构内部规章、既定规则等，以第2款规定的方式公布有关内部规章、既定规则等，对政策的制定、实施或修改等进行行政通知。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1217,"end":1444,"target_id":"50d91ce9029755f7f13f690a117fec0fd62fc54fc2c8319388d8fde53d8b45bf","source_hash":"8ecd180ec3e673d3c753560fed5869d8d83b43b482a7a9c129e5586da40b2c4f","text":"第四条（听取有关机构的意见）\n① 各级机关负责人制定政策、制度、计划以及发布行政通知时，必要时可以咨询有关行政机关、组织等。\n② 根据第1款规定，对政策、制度和计划提出意见的答复期限至少为10天。但是，在出现需要紧急实施政策、制度和计划等特殊情况下，答复期限可以缩短至10天以下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1444,"end":1673,"target_id":"ba1d338824ccdcfa6db45da9899fdbd21a12220e64edc225ea3ae3ba49709ed0","source_hash":"8583a22cc657ea2cae895a3d20a51583d508fefb0bd76e74b62ee6209386354e","text":"第五条（行政通知、统计汇编和公告）\n① 各机关负责人应当每年统计其所发布行政通知的执行情况和结果，并在本机关网站上公布。但如有必要，各机关负责人也可通过《官方公报》或《法院公报》公布其所发布行政通知的执行情况和结果统计。\n② 根据第1款规定，行政通知统计的公开公布应当按照附件表格第2号表格进行。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1673,"end":1799,"target_id":"d4ef6f66b4b4a9ef90927ccf73cbd17b013a153c63bff771351cb80773ba8d83","source_hash":"5e36e933e78f4ebc55a89b8075565aae3719d59d0781d7794d28f6bb91b1fb99","text":"第六条（授权和通知）\n① 各级机关可在其内部规章中确定执行行政通知所必需的事项。\n② 各机关负责人应当按照本条例附件3表格的规定，将他/她所发出的任何行政通知通知法院行政办公室部长（隶属于法律事务官员管辖）。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1799,"end":1843,"target_id":"8b4ca0b9a43be76ea07901c4e5d42d2241c16782b3b84f2653d59b257b499dec","source_hash":"64c4c745e037ef41ef6ba1ae522a19c2e329cab3f69b6dfc3687f0646fa1930b","text":"补充规定 <2020年6月26日第2904号>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1843,"end":1912,"target_id":"8afb3f99dac96d3b9d320c12406c66e4437f5eadf4ba0c127dc4e1f1423f595c","source_hash":"7ea80b5e4483de1f366b1618cd387b354d5c57ef0d8d0ab0bcf32560dd745e77","text":"补充规定 <2969号，2021年3月25日>\n\n本规则自公布之日起生效，但自2021年2月9日起适用。\n\n行政通知\n"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00001","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820339","source_hash":"e0adaec0e0e818c5bb6fad8647c706f6008d02a28a017cbbe7783d89dbc0cce2","text":"附件表格编号1"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00002","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820340","source_hash":"81b3b1414cefe0bdd531e1a8c9477327b30bad553c2f5f6e236c83144be71cff","text":"正在制定或修订的内部规章、先例或指南的名称，或须经行政通知的行政行为的名称"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00003","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820341","source_hash":"77e557574acaec39226c326f3d20690b39fd705f32290daddaa0cd31d1a11a61","text":"以上内容，等等？ 管理通知"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00004","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820342","source_hash":"bbb6a2ca174646f0f0d5f6a1c9e7edaab20033d99b81970f10b8901d441912cb","text":"■ ○○ 法院通知编号："},{"id":"A38583-zh-00005","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820343","source_hash":"a08cc7e0aa3f3b5bcf6d47b1251beac5eb62fe82822820fd68aea175dc282f09","text":"正在颁布或修订的内部规章、先例或指南的名称，或须经行政公示的行政行为等？是否提前向公众公布？"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00006","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820344","source_hash":"a67b3cad4ce9309f9bc32c2e1d8fc60ea3f3bd70ea28462afc9af7c9c4016dc1","text":"根据《行政程序法》第46条的规定，现将此事的目的和详情公布如下，征求意见。"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00007","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820345","source_hash":"5c3fd37894681c5465640bc11202b9b680882881433324c5152905cfc8a09fdc","text":"○○○○年○○月○○日"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00008","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820346","source_hash":"680674a7c7639809e0bf596c6d8c6a941b8442d5f3ea9ada021d04f92a58cdc6","text":"○○ 法院院长"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00009","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820347","source_hash":"9827b330102f79d8a83483051aabdc78f5f2b82d03704cab1914727fe514b983","text":"1. 行政通知理由（修改理由）"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00010","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820348","source_hash":"d51a5fefacebaaa14f9c9397b97b7d712bd9f1d3edef8ab3e133051bf3e32322","text":"2. 主要内容"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00011","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820349","source_hash":"a07fb01b41f260959f3a3f7f674a50676a7423a10f5ad3868b67e4b7619be8cf","text":"3. 过程"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00012","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820350","source_hash":"f27ae695421dc7e981fa20f8089e8b91b84c371e8347552a306779eb9366ea50","text":"4. 提交意见"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00013","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820351","source_hash":"dcc7f7267c2cb7205bfc0eecf1462819d28296b8741bf73f727d6ec47c0630b9","text":"关于“正在颁布或修订的内部规则、先例或指南的名称，或须经行政通知的行政行为等”？"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00014","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820352","source_hash":"3e91bad6ed10ebdfebe97ea4e7be0d99a8f47f77caf4bbf6cd74a9f8bb315e28","text":"个人或组织如有任何意见，可于○○○○年○月○日之前，根据○○法案提交包含以下信息的书面意见。"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00015","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820353","source_hash":"8fdaa79be19ec8c0198b30f2a9717f8afc281821d8f92da72d194bdc56a04f29","text":"请提交给主任。"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00016","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820354","source_hash":"0f6088216e5d45968e1b4208c1326945f4597f416e89b5e5210cb79cc3c275ca","text":"关于该通知的意见（赞成或反对，以及理由）"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00017","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820355","source_hash":"19ed7f4df6a1c3f916a5433a62b6c9b73c0cf60bbb417f52dce0107750676b7a","text":"名称（如为组织机构，请提供组织机构名称及其代表姓名）、地址和电话号码"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00018","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820356","source_hash":"695e40c6745fa017e397573231d740446921229a7fdc46c4a233d0a9703a6757","text":"在哪里提交评论"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00019","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820357","source_hash":"2af435d00ffcc5ad114732b95ab9f7da2d7e2d7c5dbbe278631f45bf0c047645","text":"[邮政编码 ○○○○○] 地址"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00020","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820358","source_hash":"ca25696e007cb2b05a416991611856af3bcddd8fb9e49df3c388959930eaed4f","text":"收件人：○○法院首席法官，抄送：○○○○办公室 ○○○○○○办公室"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00021","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820359","source_hash":"4a14c076aa2db81afd08a07099489157d8cf19d7e171103be3cd241142017dc4","text":"电话：联系人电话号码，传真：联系人传真号码"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00022","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820360","source_hash":"4b33f6c3a922010d7b42c2f1ee439a246b4867e27606d6f73d08c4f389a26187","text":"E-mail : 联系人电子邮件地址@scourt.go.kr"},{"id":"A38583-zh-00023","doc":"A38583","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820361","source_hash":"9fbaa13e7f593c4e1574650ce5ba4c4546ed3f01154f4b39272eaa03048c7897","text":"请查阅附件以获取行政通知草案全文。"},{"id":"A38584-zh-00001","doc":"A38584","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820362","source_hash":"2266af39af3c5867da4decf45ed8c0930c2d859d66080512e8ffe3f8bcba708a","text":"附件表格编号2"},{"id":"A38584-zh-00002","doc":"A38584","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820363","source_hash":"1519f336ce4128d1fbb6a44dbd0962f1644c0c8d9dbd836c74b10f2919e0e073","text":"○○ 法院行政通知执行情况公告"},{"id":"A38584-zh-00003","doc":"A38584","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820364","source_hash":"fedf292819e3ec9ab1e6fb819543e830af9d990849031dbbcca48055d0be8fe4","text":"根据《行政程序法》第46条之2和《司法行政预先通知规则》第5条的规定，○○法院"},{"id":"A38584-zh-00004","doc":"A38584","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820365","source_hash":"a093ee71c5090cbc0423061bb9f1cc6e09f3ef4bd016428208656bc4949074e3","text":"年份"},{"id":"A38584-zh-00005","doc":"A38584","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820366","source_hash":"1a88538aa278647d54b2cf260385dc6a8b30b545449787694e45fc7e5f44ef6f","text":"现将已进行的行政通知的执行情况公布如下。"},{"id":"A38584-zh-00006","doc":"A38584","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820367","source_hash":"3f0d9ef414facc9f4cdaa2885109065d366d8165e3ba8ea89fc58c9976dc91a5","text":"1。"},{"id":"A38584-zh-00007","doc":"A38584","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820368","source_hash":"753de7d38acaea77ba4e12b4605f2ec8dea20928341563327537a89f2b04dbc3","text":"项目：○○ 法院在 ○○ 年执行行政通知的情况"},{"id":"A38584-zh-00008","doc":"A38584","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820369","source_hash":"0555441bce9df998c8b58935a84089f5039c467b2c6784b7ad2c84e4dd701b5f","text":"2. 行政通知执行情况统计"},{"id":"A38584-zh-00009","doc":"A38584","law_id":"kr-013804-230577-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2820370","source_hash":"9a2995a40c32906c132e0c0c8b659919da364f103854fba970863186d67707b7","text":"(单位：案例)"},{"id":"A38584-zh-00010","doc":"A38584","law_id"